## Commented, kept open (1)

#943 — no code, but I settled the question the issue says nobody could settle from source, by asking the provider. It 400s on the first turn: max_tokens: 131072 > 128000, which is the maximum allowed number of output tokens for claude-fable-5-1. Both readings in the issue were wrong in opposite directions — the preset's 64,000 is a default, not a ceiling, and the true max is 128,000, not 131,072. That changes the design: the naive configured > preset.max_tokens check warns on legal values in (64_000, 128_000], and clamping to "the ceiling already in hand" would silently send half the budget. Worth recording before anyone ships the obvious version.

